# Human production approver for the A0.5 spike.
# CODEOWNERS is evaluated from the BASE branch, so a pull request cannot
# rewrite the ownership policy that governs its own review requirement.
# Later patterns win; every pattern here resolves to the same owner.

*                        @arrowmuse-tech

# Restate ownership of the controls themselves, so any attempt to weaken the
# gate is itself gated.
/.github/                @arrowmuse-tech
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @arrowmuse-tech
/.github/workflows/      @arrowmuse-tech
/deploy/                 @arrowmuse-tech
